Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 23:02:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] comms: fix FragmentJmapAccount compile errors
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add import android.graphics.Color (was missing)
- Remove account.ignore_schedule / onlyWifi / vpnOnly — not per-account fields
- Cast view to ViewGroup for Helper.setViewsEnabled()
- Remove SSLHelper.getSocketFactory (class doesn't exist); insecure TLS bypass deferred
- Fix R.string: title_account_delete_ask→title_account_delete, add title_comms_jmap_connect_success
- Split applyFolderSelections into applyFolderTypeSelections (db.folder().setFolderType)
  + applySwipeSelections (sets account.swipe_left/swipe_right/move_to Long ids on EntityAccount)
